# /privacy and /terms were never wired up as real routes in this SPA (no
# <Route> in src/App.tsx, no page component) - every visit fell through to
# the client-side NotFound catch-all, served with a 200 status since React
# Router (not the server) determines the 404. The Shopify App Store listing
# links directly to these URLs, so a reviewer hit a dead page immediately.
# app.getfincile.com already has real, working /privacy and /terms pages -
# redirect here at the server level (works even without JS/for crawlers)
# rather than duplicating legal content across two codebases.
/privacy https://app.getfincile.com/privacy 301
/terms https://app.getfincile.com/terms 301
